     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:Times\">Can anyone explain why using DWLS estimator for the\r\nsame data and the same model, gives another results when data are declared as\r\nnumeric and ordered factors?</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Times\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Times\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Times\">Here an example with such difference:</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Times\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Times\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">library(lavaan)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">load(file = &quot;./data.Rda&quot;)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">model = &quot;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">  F1 =~ KE3 + KE4 + KE5 + KE6 + KE8 +\r\nKE9 + KE10 + KE11 + KE12</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">  F2 =~ KS3 + KS4 + KS6 + KS7 + KS10\r\n+ KS11 + KS12 + KS13</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">  F1 ~~ F2</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">&quot;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">fit_num &lt;- cfa(model = model, data =\r\ndata_num, estimator = &quot;DWLS&quot;)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">summary(fit_num)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">fitmeasures(object = fit_num, fit.measures\r\n= c(&quot;chisq&quot;, &quot;cfi&quot;, &quot;tli&quot;))</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u> <u></u></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Helvetica;font-size:9pt\"> </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">fit_ord_2 &lt;- cfa(model = model, data =\r\ndata_ord)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">summary(fit_ord_2)</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:Helvetica;color:black\">fitmeasures(object\r\n= fit_ord_2, fit.measures = c(&quot;chisq&quot;, &quot;cfi&quot;,\r\n&quot;tli&quot;))</span>    <span><font color=\"#888888\"><br></font></span></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><span><font color=\"#888888\">\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br></font></span></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
    ],
